WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.955 --> 00:00:14.775
We should have brought the shrink-gun.

2
00:00:15.555 --> 00:00:17.176
We could zap them right now.

3
00:00:17.196 --> 00:00:20.277
Brad: Danny, we can't do it with people around!

4
00:00:20.297 --> 00:00:22.597
Danny: Are you kidding?

5
00:00:23.418 --> 00:00:24.418
We would be heroes!

6
00:00:24.438 --> 00:00:27.679
Danny: It would be like we were back in Ginormous!

7
00:00:27.699 --> 00:00:29.579
Brad: What do you mean?

8
00:00:29.599 --> 00:00:32.040
Danny: Think about it!

9
00:00:32.704 --> 00:00:36.987
Danny: After we shrank them, we could keep Chuck and Dave in glass jars.

10
00:00:37.007 --> 00:00:39.709
Danny: All the other kids would rejoice.

11
00:00:39.729 --> 00:00:45.673
Danny: They would lift us onto their shoulders, and there would [n3@be a parade and a big feast!

12
00:00:47.174 --> 00:00:48.515
Brad: Umm, Danny.

13
00:00:48.855 --> 00:00:49.675
Do you see him?

14
00:00:49.695 --> 00:00:51.477
Danny: You mean, Mr.

15
00:00:51.557 --> 00:00:55.739
Smith? Brad: He might not celebrate if we shrunk the bullies.

16
00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:57.981
Danny: I suppose.

17
00:00:58.001 --> 00:01:00.042
Brad: We need a plan.

18
00:01:00.062 --> 00:01:02.184
Danny: You're good at plans.

19
00:01:02.964 --> 00:01:03.724
Have you got one?

20
00:01:03.744 --> 00:01:07.445
Brad: Well, we need to find a way to get them alone.

21
00:01:12.267 --> 00:01:15.247
Right. But we don't want them to suspect anything.

22
00:01:15.267 --> 00:01:16.808
Brad: Hmm.

23
00:01:17.488 --> 00:01:22.269
If we could get them to follow us Danny: Do you have an idea?

24
00:01:22.289 --> 00:01:27.411
Danny: Ha-ha!

25
00:01:27.771 --> 00:01:28.791
You're a genius!

26
00:01:28.811 --> 00:01:31.832
Brad: Well, I have my moments of brilliance.

27
00:01:32.984 --> 00:01:35.486
Tina: Hi.

28
00:01:35.546 --> 00:01:37.787
Brad: Hi, Tina.

29
00:01:37.807 --> 00:01:39.148
Danny: Tina?

30
00:01:39.468 --> 00:01:40.228
Who's Tina?

31
00:01:41.049 --> 00:01:42.109
I don't think I know her.

32
00:01:42.129 --> 00:01:43.790
Tina: Danny.

33
00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:45.852
Danny: Do you hear something?

34
00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:49.894
Tina: I just came to say that I hope you change your minds.

35
00:01:50.795 --> 00:01:51.175
Brad: Okay.

36
00:01:51.195 --> 00:01:54.837
Tina: Becoming a bully isn't the way to deal with bullies.

37
00:01:55.717 --> 00:01:56.118
Brad: Okay.

38
00:01:56.138 --> 00:01:59.660
Tina: Danny, aren't you going to say anything?

39
00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:04.001
Danny: Brad, there's an annoying buzzing sound, like a pest.

40
00:02:04.722 --> 00:02:06.983
Tina: Hopian would be ashamed of you.

41
00:02:07.003 --> 00:02:09.804
Danny: Don't say that about Hopian!

42
00:02:10.784 --> 00:02:11.565
I saved him!

43
00:02:11.945 --> 00:02:12.825
He's my friend.

44
00:02:12.845 --> 00:02:16.427
Tina: I'm sorry, Danny.

45
00:02:17.247 --> 00:02:19.748
I think Hopian would say the same thing I'm saying.

46
00:02:19.768 --> 00:02:22.189
Brad: Danny, stop it.

47
00:02:22.209 --> 00:02:25.651
Danny: I never want to see you again!

48
00:02:25.671 --> 00:02:28.032
Tina: We'll see about that.

49
00:02:33.152 --> 00:02:33.852
Chuck: Ha-ha!

50
00:02:34.552 --> 00:02:36.353
What do you think happened here?

51
00:02:36.373 --> 00:02:40.994
Dave: I think the boyfriend and girlfriend had a fight.

52
00:02:41.014 --> 00:02:43.795
Danny: She's not my girlfriend!

53
00:02:43.815 --> 00:02:46.796
Chuck: She broke his heart!

54
00:02:47.216 --> 00:02:50.877
Brad: You two should watch out.

55
00:02:50.897 --> 00:02:53.398
Chuck: What are you talking about?

56
00:02:53.418 --> 00:02:56.659
Brad: I don't think you want to make us mad.

57
00:02:56.679 --> 00:02:59.239
Dave: Oh no?
